{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>***** THE GAMEPLAY TRAILER CONTAINS OUTDATED GRAPHICS *****</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Chronicles of Vaeltaja: In Search of the Great Wanderer takes you back to the golden era of pc gaming, when role-playing games such as Might and Magic,  Wizardry and Ultima ruled the world. Experience the classic feel of adventuring and role-playing on a grid-based journey through the colourful kingdom of Twin Falls where sunny fields, lush forests, misty swamps and dark dungeons await to be explored!</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421440/extras/Screenshot__1981_.png?t=1742779475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Gather a party of six adventurers from 11 character classes and choose their equipment from dozens of weapons, armor and trinkets. Improve your characters through classic 'stat and skill' system and teach them class specific skills to take down dangerous enemies in tactical turn-based battles. Follow the main questline to unravel the secret of the Great Wanderer and take on side-quests to earn experience, coins and better equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421440/extras/Screenshot__2096_.png?t=1742779475\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Classic six character party system with 11 character classes, such as Warrior, Mage, Witch Hunter, Knight, Conjurer and Guardian, with their own unique skills and spells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hire more than six characters to experience with different party builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat your enemies in tactical turn-based combat with lots of status effects that can change the course of the battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore dangerous and dark dungeons full of puzzles, traps and enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick locks, disarm traps and solve puzzles to progress in your adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact with dozens of non-player characters for side-quests, rumours and hints</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dig treasures, find secrets and gather crafting materials for potions, weapons and armor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the classic feel of adventuring from the golden era of pc gaming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> No forced tutorials, no hand-holding, no cinematic cutscenes, just pure fun of experiencing and exploring</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Graphics and mechanics may change for the final release.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421440/extras/Screenshot__2015_.png?t=1742779475\" /></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2421440?t=1742779475","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2421440?t=1742779475","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421440/e1afa31a47a76981ba1a8ffb4da75b666f46dde0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742779475","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421440/e1afa31a47a76981ba1a8ffb4da75b666f46dde0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742779475","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>***** THE GAMEPLAY TRAILER CONTAINS OUTDATED GRAPHICS *****</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Chronicles of Vaeltaja: In Search of the Great Wanderer takes you back to the golden era of pc gaming, when role-playing games such as Might and Magic,  Wizardry and Ultima ruled the world. Experience the c