ns, weapons and armor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the classic feel of adventuring from the golden era of pc gaming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> No forced tutorials, no hand-holding, no cinematic cutscenes, just pure fun of experiencing and exploring</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Graphics and mechanics may change for the final release.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421440/extras/Screenshot__2015_.png?t=1742779475\" /></p></li></ul>","developers":["Witchgrove Games"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421440/header.jpg?t=1742779475","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyrights 2022, 2025 Jani Noitalehto","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257002506,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257002506/movie480.mp4?t=1708547992","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257002506/movie_max.mp4?t=1708547992"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257002506/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1708547992","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257002506/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1708547992","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257002506/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1708547992"}}],"name":"Chronicles of Vaeltaja: In Search of the Great Wanderer","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","s